WEBVTT

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:41.470
The lionhearted Grand Duke who has fought upon Touda to protect the Holy Kingdom of Ryoza,

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:51.180
and the pure-hearted Queen who is the subjugator of glorious beasts, the beast-lords, and an inspiration to her citizens:

00:01:52.710 --> 00:02:01.550
These two existences had created a black turmoil between the citizens of the two quarters

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:05.620
and were about to force a girl to be consumed into the maelstrom.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:34.060
<i>With the growing prosperity of the Wajyaku merchants combined together with the Grand Duke's military power,</i>

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:37.320
<i>the Queen's influence is decreasing by the day.</i>

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:45.240
<i>This country is meant for those who live under the Queen, the ones who are pure-hearted.</i>

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.830
<i>This distortion must be corrected.</i>

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:55.460
<i>To do so, poisons are necessary at times.</i>

00:02:56.790 --> 00:03:01.260
<i>You understand this necessity, right, Kiriku?</i>

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:16.710
Beastinarian

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:25.390
I know.  I'll let you out now.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:05.530
<i>If one obeys the Beast-Lord Imperatives and raises a beast-lord using benetrophic water and the mute whistle,</i>

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>they do not fly nor will they bear young.</i>

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:13.160
<i>Why do you think we would need to do such a thing?</i>

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:23.320
<i>The purpose of the Beast-Lord Imperatives is to prevent a repeat of the tragedy the Founding Queen Je experienced.</i>

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:35.020
<i>I do not want to keep Lilan confined in a small cage to prevent disaster, when I do not even know if it would come to pass.</i>

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:45.490
<i>But if Lilan and I turn into the cause of disaster like everyone fears,</i>

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.890
<i>when that happens,</i>

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:52.980
<i>I should be the only one prosecuted, and I will gladly give my life for it.</i>

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:00.630
<i>If everything can be prevented by my death,</i>

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.840
<i>then I can follow my beliefs until the end.</i>

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.600
<i>You're strong.  Very strong.</i>

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:27.690
<i>Thank you.  I'm thankful that you shared your secrets with me.</i>

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:30.410
<i>I understand how you feel.</i>

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:34.910
<i>I'll void the request I made to have you protect me on the way to the capital.</i>

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.790
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:02.550
I'll now show how to graft the wild apple tree, so listen well.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.580
Okay!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.740
Your name means "wild apple," right?

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.200
Erin-sensei?

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.240
Erin-sensei!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.920
What's wrong, Shiron?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:27.170
Next year, when the fruit is ripe on the trees, I'll give you the first one I pick.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.910
"Next year?"

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.640
Thank you, Shiron.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.900
Make sure you water them plenty.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:52.990
Erin!

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.990
Messengers from the Queen are here to take Lilan away!

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:25.960
I'd like you to take us to that beast-lord.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.110
Right away.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.700
Yes, that's it.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.930
Lilan is being aggressive!

00:07:57.930 --> 00:07:59.100
Please step back.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:05.810
We can restrain it with the mute whistle in the case of an emergency.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.440
Please wait!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.160
Erin.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:21.530
You got here fast.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:33.960
By the order of Her Royal Highness, Queen Seimiya, we've come for you.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:48.020
Accept the decree with honor to transfer to Lazal with the beast-lords you have raised in order to protect the Queen.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:54.730
It is a great honor, but I must humbly decline.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.570
Do you understand what it means to disobey?

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.060
Yes.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.660
To go against the decree would mean a death sentence, you know?

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.070
I'm aware.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.940
Don't blow that!

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.440
Please!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.280
Lilan!

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.230
Don't!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:22.230
<i>This country is meant for those who are pure-hearted.</i>

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.910
Pure-hearted ones...

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:34.620
<i>To do so, poisons are necessary at times.</i>

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.830
<i>You understand this necessity, right, Kiriku?</i>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.860
Is this really the right thing to do?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:49.010
A bird inside a cage can't fly in the sky.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:55.540
By thinking only of the beast-lord and trying to live the best life she can...

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:02.570
Does that make Erin the most pure-hearted one?

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:09.610
Yet here I am, trying to put her in a cage.

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.440
<i>What's wrong, Erin?</i>

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.870
<i>Mom...?</i>

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:05.380
<i>I restrained Lilan with the mute whistle!</i>

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:13.970
<i>Mom!  You said you didn't like seeing Touda petrify the moment you blew the whistle, right?!</i>

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.520
<i>I didn't like it either!</i>

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:28.030
<i>I didn't like seeing them becoming weaker and weaker by using benetrophic water and the mute whistle!</i>

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:35.950
<i>Did you want to raise them as if they were living freely in the wild?</i>

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.570
Mom...

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.740
You were crying out for your mother there.

00:14:57.010 --> 00:15:02.520
Thank the gods that you and the beast-lord handlers didn't die.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.620
Lilan took my fingers?

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.260
My hand...

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:35.120
I heard that those men were the people who took Lilan to the Queen when she was still a baby.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.190
What's Lilan doing?

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:55.310
She was very aggravated so I instructed to have her chained down and put in the shed.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.780
Lilan was scared.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:07.830
I had seen that, but I couldn't stop her.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.090
Don't blame yourself.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:18.050
If it wasn't for the Queen's decree, I could separate you from Lilan.

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:28.690
A beast-lord will never befriend an individual who blows a mute whistle.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:37.360
I may not be able to calm Lilan without the use of the mute whistle anymore.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:44.480
Even so, I don't want to give up on taking care of Lilan just because of this.

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:54.410
Even if I have to use the mute whistle, I will go with Lilan.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:01.120
You're choosing a very hard path.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:06.980
You'll have to do what you hate the most to Lilan.

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.090
I'm ready for it.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:16.050
Yes.  You must be the kind of person who walks that path.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:22.030
Some may wonder why you choose to live like that,

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:25.540
but the way you live so honestly, true to your heart...

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.710
I really respect it.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:18:02.160
As soon as Erin recovered enough to stand, she visited the man being treated.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:09.250
She offered all the financial incentives she received from the Queen to the man in apology,

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:14.750
but the men would not listen to her words, instead only giving hateful glares.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.550
Lilan, come outside.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.570
Stop with the growling.

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.740
I said stop it, Lilan.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.700
If you do not listen to me, I will blow it.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:10.720
Come outside.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:27.620
Phew.  Lilan hasn't stepped outside since that day, so now we can finally clean her shed.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:44.090
I'm a beastinarian.

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:57.480
I will raise beasts and live with them through days of hardships and worry,

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.940
just like Mom did.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:43.690
A few days later, the carriage to transport Lilan came from the capital.

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:51.700
Sleeping pills were fed to them and they were put on the carriage while they were in a deep sleep.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:31.450
Esal-sensei, where's Kiriku-sensei?

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.310
He's gone to Lazal with Erin.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.350
To Lazal?

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.990
Why did he go?

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.620
I wasn't privy to the reason.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.420
It was an order from the palace.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:47.210
What will happen to Erin now?

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:53.180
There's nothing we can do now.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:59.230
So let's continue to watch her future from here.

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:09.440
After all, that's all we can do.

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:19.900
Upon facing such a giant, irresistible force, Erin began thinking anew:

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:24.460
"I will live strong until the end."

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:06.050
As the day of the battle at Tahai Aze approaches,

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:08.810
where people of the Queen's quarter and
the Grand Duke's quarter will fight,

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:13.980
I am taken away from Kazalm and
into Damiya-sama's room.

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:20.190
There, I'm ordered to make an army of beast-lords to counter the Touda army.

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:24.150
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Akun Me Chai.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:26:00.070
Akun me Chai
